---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import { COMPANY } from '../lib/company';
const user = Astro.locals.user;
---
<Base title="Support — Easy Screen Capture">
  <div class="page">
    <SiteHeader user={user} />
    <main class="wrap prose-wrap stack gap-20" style="padding-block: 48px 64px">
      <header class="stack gap-8">
        <p class="small muted">Easy Screen Capture · Web and iOS help</p>
        <h1 class="h2">How can we help?</h1>
        <p>Get help with your account, captures, monitor history or notifications.</p>
      </header>
      <section class="stack gap-8">
        <h2 class="h4">Contact support</h2>
        <p>Email <a href={`mailto:${COMPANY.email}`}>{COMPANY.email}</a>. Include the device and app or browser version,
          what you were trying to do, and any error message. Please do not send passwords, API keys or private screenshots.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="stack gap-8">
        <h2 class="h4">Signing in and verifying your email</h2>
        <p>Use the same Easy Screen Capture email and password on the web and in the iOS app.
          Check your inbox and spam folder for the verification message. In the iOS account screen,
          choose Resend verification email if needed. Contact us if you cannot access your account.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="stack gap-8">
        <h2 class="h4">Finding a capture</h2>
        <p>Regular captures are separate from monitor albums. Open the album for the relevant monitor to see its checks.
          Files are kept for your plan's retention period. Deleted or expired captures are no longer available.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="stack gap-8">
        <h2 class="h4">Not receiving change alerts?</h2>
        <p>The first monitor check establishes a baseline. A later check must detect a change above the configured
          threshold before a change alert is sent. Confirm that the monitor is active and your account has capture allowance.</p>
        <p>For iOS push, open You → Push notifications → Enable change alerts and allow notifications.
          Check notification permissions and Focus settings on your device. Email alerts are a separate monitor preference;
          check your account email address and spam folder.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="stack gap-8">
        <h2 class="h4">Sharing a page from Safari</h2>
        <p>Open Safari's share sheet, choose Easy Capture and save the URL. Then open the Easy Capture app
          to review the capture settings and start the capture.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="stack gap-8" id="delete-account">
        <h2 class="h4">Deleting your account and data</h2>
        <p>In the iOS app, open You → Delete my account, enter your password and confirm.
          You can also delete your account from the website's account screen. This permanently deletes the account
          and its captures and cancels an active subscription. Use individual capture deletion if you only want to remove one image.</p>
        <p>If you cannot sign in, email support for help. Read the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>
          for retention details and data requests.</p>
      </section>
    </main>
    <SiteFooter />
  </div>
</Base>
